{"data": {"node": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "8042609382449376", "organization": {"id": "121107759622740", "viewer_permissions": [], "application_groupings": {"nodes": [{"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "8042609382449376"}]}, "id": "450969924233286"}]}}, "firstRevision": {"nodes": [{"application": {"id": "8042609382449376", "release_date": 1767359700, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "27365239019759790"}, "id": "753154060315458"}]}}, "binary": null, "live_binary": null, "created_date": 1778750094, "id": "27365441386406220", "is_initial_release": false, "name_with_fallback": "v4", "pdp_metadata_with_fallback": {"version": 4, "application": {"is_concept": false, "latest_released_pdp_metadata": {"id": "27365447799738912"}, "release_status": "RELEASED", "id": "8042609382449376"}, "id": "27365447799738912", "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "release_date": null, "administration_status": "APPROVED", "is_first": false, "release_status": "RELEASED", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "8042609382449376", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "643304932110041"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1684255772607402", "locale": "pt_BR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Block Climbing", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Escale por 30 n\u00edveis internos \u00fanicos, repletos de machadinhas de gelo, apoios quebr\u00e1veis, cordas e muitas surpresas. Algumas paredes convidam voc\u00ea a se tornar o arquiteto da rota: coloque novos apoios com a pistola de apoios ou mova segmentos inteiros da parede para criar seu pr\u00f3prio caminho at\u00e9 o topo.\n\nAumente sua velocidade, descubra atalhos escondidos e corra contra os fantasmas de outros jogadores. Os melhores tempos aparecem em blockclimbingvr.com, onde voc\u00ea pode comparar seus resultados e ver como se posiciona entre os melhores.", "short_description": "Escale por 30 n\u00edveis internos \u00fanicos, repletos de machadinhas de gelo, apoios quebr\u00e1veis, cordas e surpresas. Em algumas paredes, voc\u00ea se torna o arquiteto: coloque apoios personalizados com a pistola de apoios ou mova segmentos da parede para criar sua pr\u00f3pria rota. Divirta-se, encontre atalhos e busque tempos de recorde mundial."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Block_Climbing_square.png", "id": "4466573493574779", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820441_4466573496908112_2041745852006523747_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=z1fNNKQ2lUEQ7kNvwH62iwo&_nc_oc=AdosaDWguzaUKX2RfyoE1AlRUUM5LDGYHgnlmdvGOA0u-A4-iTfA9hTleGkaxbuE-84&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8rPWIiR-uGHbD5mwv6T3snWvHoOPclaqpSW8h55LBlyA&oe=6A2812AE"}, {"file_name": "Block_Climbing_vertical.png", "id": "1529206954956785", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821796_1529206961623451_8395849857138609080_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9OrycnjRevoQ7kNvwHtHtLr&_nc_oc=AdqJuX163ewDjbdCc8Xa1mL_hd1kkjpLywxvq1iDegakYnxuYNkkk5U9bsoF32GdV6w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_Jkvz73HwZQ8_iUbTO-IOg5blvBdJNHRXiMteTENdk1A&oe=6A280977"}, {"file_name": "Block_Climbing_hero.png", "id": "1441941860825038", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1441941864158371_4868665418579865862_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MoCqEl-sIYAQ7kNvwG9hXdA&_nc_oc=Adq1Mn